.git
output
dl
# Device backups (docs/recovery.md tells you to take a full 7.6 GB eMMC dump
# before the first write). These are NOT build inputs and must never be pulled
# into the build context — a multi-GB context slows every build to a crawl.
backups
# NOTE the ** — a bare *.img only matches the context root, so it did not cover
# backups/<board>/*.img and the dumps were being shipped to the daemon.
**/*.img
**/*.bin
docs
